#==============================================================================================
#
#   keyboard_event_1 - UIEvents::KeyboardEvent: the key, code and location of a platform key
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/UIEvents/KeyboardEvent.cpp lines 18-344: determine_key_code,
#       determine_char_code, get_event_named_key, get_event_key_string, is_glyph_modifier_key,
#       remove_non_glyph_modifier_keys and get_event_key. The tables are the donor's switches,
#       arm for arm. A KeyCode's own value (the "virtual key code from the operating system")
#       is the donor's u8 value: the port's enum carries the generator's signed reading of it.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2021-2022, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
